: Why does everyone thing the luckstone is so useless?

: Your luck gets added to your "to hit" roll.  With a luckstone and an
: aligned unicorn or altar, you can get your luck up to +10.  Your "to
: hit" roll is from 1 to 20.  With that +10 added on, a character at
: about level 10 or so (reasonable after completing mines) should
: _never_ miss an attack!

Actually I have found in wizard mode, with a blessed luckstone, your luck
can get as high as 13.

: I could be wrong on a couple of these, but luck is _very_ important
: for combat, fountains, and praying.

Very true.

